Nokyung is an open source Tai Lue font package for New Tai Lue
(Xishuangbanna Dai) characters. It includes the complete Unicode range of
New Tai Lue consonants, vowels, tones, and digits, along with punctuation
and other useful symbols.

The New Tai Lue script is used by approximately 300,000 people who speak the
Xishuangbanna Dai language in Yunnan, China. It is a simplification of the
Tai Tham (Old Tai Lue) script as used for this language for hundreds of
years.
